{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>The Nefilim.</b> Wondrous in height; defective alef, like ונפלינו אני ועמך." "<b>Were on the earth in those days.</b> Those mentioned above — ״ויהי כי החל״ etc., and ״ויראו בני האלהים״ etc." "<b>And also after that.</b> After HaShem grew angry with them, as it is written ״לא ידון רוחי באדם״ etc. — they did not submit, until the sons of Elohim came to the daughters of men." "<b>Men of the Name.</b> Rabbi Acha said: but is it not written about the men of the flood, ״בני נבל גם בני בלי שם נכאו מן הארץ״ — and you say 'men of Name'? Rather, they named the world, and were blotted out from the world."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:08.696228311Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}